			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Update Mountain submodule to enforce PascalCase across DNS, TLS, and IPC layers\n\nUpdate the Mountain element submodule from b96ba615 to 7e880716 to align with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention mandated in CLAUDE.md.\n\n**Mountain:** Systematically rename Tauri commands, helper functions, and struct fields in the DNS, TLS, and IPC modules. New diagnostic commands (`DnsGetForwardAllowlist`, `TlsInitialize`) and internal utilities (`GetMemoryUsage`) are updated to PascalCase. IPC handlers for `ConfigurationBridge` and `WindAdvancedSync` now export PascalCase identifiers. Update all call sites in `WindServiceHandlers`, `ProcessManagement`, and `Track::Effect` to match the new signatures.\n\n**Impact:** Eliminates naming inconsistencies across the native backend and IPC boundary, ensuring strict adherence to the effect-based architectural principles and the project's style guide.",
			"SHA": "c2b71ca3b897313e720bc981c54c9a5e871fd000"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-23T16:15:12Z",
